              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            }
          ],
          "benefits_md": "\n- As per the assistance norms fixed by the State Government, keeping in view the natural calamities that occur from time to time\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "The scheme provides financial assistance to farmers in Gujarat who suffer crop losses due to natural calamities, based on crop damage surveys conducted by the district administration.",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The scheme \"Crop Input Subsidy to the Farmers for Crop Loss Due to Natural Calamities\" introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to support farmers whose crops have been damaged by natural disasters such as floods, droughts, unseasonal rains, or other calamities. After a damage assessment is conducted by the district administration, eligible farmers receive compensation based on assistance norms defined by the State Government."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme &amp;quot;Crop Input Subsidy to the Farmers for Crop Loss Due to Natural Calamities&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to support farmers whose crops have been damaged by natural disasters such as floods, droughts, unseasonal rains, or other calamities. After a damage assessment is conducted by the district administration, eligible farmers receive compensation based on assistance norms defined by the State Government.\n",
